# # /ontocraft/
#
# Permanent identifiers for OntoCraft's Korean industrial term registry
# (SKOS concepts, CC BY 4.0).
#
# https://w3id.org/ontocraft/terms/<id> redirects to
# https://ontocraft.com/terms/<id>, which serves HTML or JSON-LD
# depending on the Accept header. https://w3id.org/ontocraft/ redirects
# to the registry home page.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# OntoCraft
# GitHub username: jeromwolf

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^terms/(.*)$ https://ontocraft.com/terms/$1 [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^$ https://ontocraft.com/terms [R=302,L]
